let __v_204 = Value::from("Walking on it the day after the operation, off the sticks at about 6 weeks, driving again at 6 weeks once you can do an emergency stop without thinking, and back to desk work at 6 to 12 weeks: hospital is usually 2 to 4 nights for a hip and 1 to 3 for a knee, and full recovery is 6 to 12 months for a hip and up to a year for a knee. Kneeling after a knee replacement is uncomfortable for most people and may never come back fully. Ring the ward or 111 if the wound starts leaking, the joint turns hot or red, or the pain suddenly gets worse.");
