let __v_233 = Value::from("A hip or knee replacement usually lasts 15 to 25 years, and about 8 in 10 are still going at 20 years; when one does wear out, a second operation to replace the worn parts is a routine job - smaller than the first, with a similar recovery. It is not a countdown: weight, activity and the wear on it decide, so the muscles kept strong and a healthy weight are what buy the time. If a joint that has been fine for years starts to ache, grind or give way, that is worth an X-ray rather than waiting.");
