let __v_264 = Value::from("Stairs are fine from the day you get home, one stair at a time with a rail and the crutches in the other hand: the good leg goes up first and the operated leg comes down first - up with the good, down with the bad - and both feet land on each step rather than one leg per stair. Sit down on the bottom step to put the sticks and slippers on rather than bending. If you live alone and the stairs are steep, ask the ward to watch you do a flight before you go home; it is a normal part of the discharge check.");
