let __v_276 = Value::from("Sleep is the awkward part for the first few weeks, and the answer depends on the joint: after a hip, sleep on your back with a pillow between the knees, or on the unoperated side with the pillow still between the knees so the new hip cannot cross the middle - keep that up for the six weeks the ward tells you. After a knee, sleep on your back with the leg straight on a pillow, or on the good side with a pillow under the new knee. A pillow under the heels stops the sheet rubbing, and a bad night is normal rather than a sign of damage.");
