let __v_327 = Value::from("A leg that swells after a hip or knee replacement is not ordinary swelling and it is worth a phone call rather than a wait: a calf that is hot, tight, red or tender, or a whole leg that swells up, can be a clot, and clots are more common in the weeks after this operation than people expect - ring the ward that did the operation or 111 and say when the swelling started. If you are also short of breath, coughing or feeling faint, that is 999. Swelling around the joint itself is the ordinary sort, and that one goes down with ice and the leg raised.");
