let __v_328 = Value::from("A new joint that feels loose, gives way or clunks hard when you put weight on it is one to have looked at rather than wait for the next appointment: ring the ward or your surgeon's team and tell them when it started and what it does. Sometimes it is weak muscle around a joint that is fine - the physio can tell you that in one visit - and sometimes the parts need checking, which is why it is a phone call rather than a wait. If it gives way and you fall, or the joint is hot and red with it, treat that as urgent: 111 the same day.");
